Important Interview Point

CodePipeline is the orchestrator.

It coordinates the different stages but does not replace CodeCommit, CodeBuild, or CodeDeploy.

AWS CI/CD Services

Service| Main Responsibility
CodeCommit| Source code management
CodeBuild| Build and test
CodeDeploy| Application deployment
CodePipeline| Pipeline orchestration

